@@@ www-rules
type: html_page
title: House rules
author: keeper
date: 1998-02-20T21:00:00-08:00
path: /rules.html
role: flavor
---
<html>
<head><title>House rules</title></head>
<body bgcolor="#000033" text="#e0e0c0">
<h2>House rules</h2>
<ol>
<li>Log what you heard, not what you hoped to hear.</li>
<li>Time, frequency, mode, location. Every time. A log without a time is a story.</li>
<li>No transmitting on frequencies you are not licensed for. We listen. That's the hobby.</li>
<li>Do not trespass on Coast Guard property. Photograph from the road.</li>
<li>Be kind to new members. Everybody hears their first numbers station once.</li>
</ol>
<p>&mdash; keeper</p>
</body>
</html>

